"       ╭ ctrl-space ───────────────────╮"
"       │        1-9 ➜ go to session    │"
"       │          , ➜ previous session │"
"       │          . ➜ next session     │"
"       │          f ➜ find a session   │"
"       │          c ➜ Chat             │"
"       │          r ➜ review           │"
"       │          s ➜ shell            │"
"       │          [ ➜ previous tab     │"
"       │          ] ➜ next tab         │"
"       │      Enter ➜ reload tab       │"
"       │          q ➜ quit             │"
"       │ ctrl-space ➜ send to program  │"
"       ╰ Esc cancel ───────────────────╯"
